    "statement": "Find the City With Fewest Reachable: Floyd-Warshall all-pairs, then count. Traverse or relax directed/undirected edges systematically while tracking visited states or shortest distances.",
    "inputDisplay": "V = 6, E = 8, src = 0",
    "render": "graph",
